{"id":"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-nucleus.md","title":"df-nucleus","display":"df-nucleus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-nucleus","aliases":["16-df-nucleus","Nucleus"],"display":"df-nucleus","depends_on":["[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Definition5.6.1 and Example5.6.2 p.354 (PDF374); §6.2 p.389 (PDF409); explicit categorical arrow equations","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-nucleus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-nucleus</span><span>Nucleus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nucleus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition5.6.1 and Example5.6.2 p.354 (PDF374); §6.2 p.389 (PDF409); explicit categorical arrow equations"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，选定分类单态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top:1\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\top:1\\to\\Omega\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_m\">\\(\\chi_m\\)</span> 表示由该泛性质唯一确定的特征箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_A:A\\to1\">\\(!_A:A\\to1\\)</span> 为终态射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 是候选箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\mu:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 由下文定义。选定初对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 及其单态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\rightarrowtail1\">\\(0\\rightarrowtail1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=\\chi_{0\\to1}\">\\(\\bot=\\chi_{0\\to1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n:N\\rightarrowtail\\Omega\">\\(n:N\\rightarrowtail\\Omega\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot!_\\Omega\">\\(\\bot!_\\Omega\\)</span> 的等化子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_\\Omega\">\\(\\neg_\\Omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_{\\neg\\neg}\">\\(j_{\\neg\\neg}\\)</span> 是下文构造的箭头。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega\\)</span> 为下文定义的箭头性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\{\\mu\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{h:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\mid\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(\\langle\\top,\\top\\rangle,\\operatorname{id}_1;h,\\top)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Nucleus}_{\\Omega}(j)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mu\\langle\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega,j\\rangle=\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega\n\\land jj=j\\land j\\mu=\\mu(j\\times j),\\\\\n\\neg_\\Omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi_n,\\qquad j_{\\neg\\neg}\\coloneqq\\neg_\\Omega\\neg_\\Omega.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\{\\mu\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{h:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\mid\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(\\langle\\top,\\top\\rangle,\\operatorname{id}_1;h,\\top)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Nucleus}_{\\Omega}(j)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mu\\langle\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega,j\\rangle=\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega\n\\land jj=j\\land j\\mu=\\mu(j\\times j),\\\\\n\\neg_\\Omega&amp;\\coloneqq\\chi_n,\\qquad j_{\\neg\\neg}\\coloneqq\\neg_\\Omega\\neg_\\Omega.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用箭头方程表达膨胀性、幂等性与交保持，避免在没有定义内部语法时把对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 当作外部集合逐元素量化。分类子唯一性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 存在且唯一；它分类同时为真的两分量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 分类“命题为假”，所以其特征箭头正是内部否定；两次复合给双重否定。初等拓扑斯中初对象严格且有限极限存在，保证这些构造。来源 Definition5.6.1及Example5.6.2 p.354 (PDF374) 的nuclei与双重否定；双重否定的Eff特例见 p.389 (PDF409)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"55e78399bad5fbe9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，选定分类单态 $\\top:1\\to\\Omega$，见 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。$\\chi_m$ 表示由该泛性质唯一确定的特征箭头；$!_A:A\\to1$ 为终态射。$\\mathrm{PbSq}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，选定分类单态 $\\top:1\\to\\Omega$，见 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。$\\chi_m$ 表示由该泛性质唯一确定的特征箭头；$!_A:A\\to1$ 为终态射。$\\mathrm{PbSq}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\top:1\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_m","display":false},{"tex":"!_A:A\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}","display":false},{"tex":"j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"0\\rightarrowtail1","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot=\\chi_{0\\to1}","display":false},{"tex":"n:N\\rightarrowtail\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot!_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"j_{\\neg\\neg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\{\\mu\\}&\\coloneqq\\{h:\\Omega\\times\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\mid\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(\\langle\\top,\\top\\rangle,\\operatorname{id}_1;h,\\top)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Nucleus}_{\\Omega}(j)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mu\\langle\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega,j\\rangle=\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega\n\\land jj=j\\land j\\mu=\\mu(j\\times j),\\\\\n\\neg_\\Omega&\\coloneqq\\chi_n,\\qquad j_{\\neg\\neg}\\coloneqq\\neg_\\Omega\\neg_\\Omega.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2097,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5fbbc7a13ebbdd7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等topos，$\\Omega$ 为指定子对象分类子，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 为 [[16-df-nucleus]] 的nucleus。$x:X\\to\\Omega$ 为广义元素。"},{"id":"e3878d9cc72edc34","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 满足 [[16-df-nucleus]] 的 $\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega(j)$；$\\top:1\\to\\Omega$、$\\chi_m:A\\to\\Omega$ 采用 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。$\\top_A=\\top\\circ!_A$，$!_A$ 为唯一终态射。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$。"},{"id":"dc7a86008fec71df","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 满足 [[16-df-nucleus]] 的 $\\mathrm{Nucleus}_\\Omega(j)$；$\\top:1\\to\\Omega$、$\\chi_m:A\\to\\Omega$ 采用 [[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。$\\top_A=\\top\\circ!_A$，$!_A$ 为唯一终态射。$X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E$。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-nucleus|df-nucleus]]"},{"id":"512abfcc793a6632","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$j_{\\neg\\neg}=\\neg_\\Omega\\neg_\\Omega$ 是 [[16-df-nucleus]] 构造的双重否定nucleus；$\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$ 与 $\\mathbf{Set}$ 的嵌入取 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]、[[16-thm-sets-embedding-eff]]。"},{"id":"628d5e147993792a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3744a99e6a5c0037","55e78399bad5fbe9","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}